        "quote": "(a) Except as described in subsection (b) of this section, upon application of the property owner, the City shall refund that portion of any trafficway impact fee which has been on deposit over five years and which is unexpended and uncommitted. The refund shall be made to the then-current owner or owners of lots or units of the development project or projects.",
