          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.55.100:block:1",
          "start": 364
        },
        "quote": "(b) If fees in any trafficway impact fee account are unexpended or uncommitted for four or more years after deposit, the City Council shall make findings by resolution, at least once each fiscal year while such condition prevails, to identify the purpose to which such fees shall be put and to show a roughly proportional and reasonable relationship between the fee and the purpose for which it was collected. If the City Council makes such findings, the fees are exempt from the refund requirement. (Ord. 18273 § 11, 6-22-04. Code 1995 § 130-770.)",
